.TH APPSWEEP 1 "August 2026" "AppSweep 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
appsweep \- safely review and remove installed Ubuntu applications
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B appsweep
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B AppSweep
is a graphical application for reviewing and removing software installed
through APT, Snap, and Flatpak.
.PP
It analyzes package-removal effects, protects critical system components,
detects supported application-data locations, and can create verified
rollback backups before removal.
.SH AUTHENTICATION
Administrative package operations use PolicyKit and may display an
authentication prompt.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/appsweep/backups/
Rollback backups created by AppSweep.
.TP
.I /usr/libexec/appsweep-helper
Privileged helper invoked through PolicyKit.
